    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: T-The confessional, it's gone? How?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: You have done well, and shown much courage. For your efforts, you shall
        find Eternity's End(tm) just a bit sooner
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: But what about the rest of the gam- I mean, journey?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Ah sure, it's up to you. Look if you wanna keep going, then turn around
        and continue
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: Otherwise go straight ahead
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
